68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-196-tome-of-the-bizarre-vol-03-16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #196 - Tome of the Bizarre Vol. 03 #16</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Enough of all this Fanatic on Fanatic violence!  Show Notes Run Time: 1:19:10 We say farewell to the spooky months with a tale full of ghosts,  mistaken identities, and hero vs. hero action! Join us next week for a Creative Process episode about...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
